# Generated by Parallax for iptables-restore --noflush. Do not edit.
# Declaring each PARALLAX_* chain creates or flushes it within the restore; apply then ensures the jumps from the built-in chains exist.
# Named sets are ipsets created by apply:
#   ipset create -exist wg_20deb125664a4b6d hash:net comment ; elements: 10.8.1.1/32, 10.8.1.2/32
